# LPMUD cookbook: the soul. One data table plus a dispatcher, replacing the
# LPC soul object's add_action-per-verb.

> create
> tester
> secretpass
> secretpass
expect: Account created

> emotes
expect: bow
expect: cackle
expect: grin
expect: smile

# Untargeted.
> smile
expect: You smile.
> bow
expect: You bow deeply.

# Targeted — `present()` by partial name.
> grin bob
expect: You grin evilly at Bob

# An emote with no targeted form refuses rather than silently dropping the arg.
> cackle bob
expect: can't cackle at someone

> smile nobody
expect: no 'nobody' here

> smile tester
expect: at yourself
